2625:  Engine is derived from the Run InitRecord, never stated. Finds the tape like find-tape, then blocks in code: streams NDJSON lifecycle_change rows and ends with one verdict {ok, run_id, harness, session_id, wal, pid, outcome, settled, lifecycle}.\n\
